+| POST | `/projects/{pid}/members/{uid}/move` | `{"toProjectId"}` → 200 `{"userId","projectId","role"}` |
+
+Moving a member removes them from `{pid}` and adds them to the destination
+with the same role. The caller must be a manager of both projects, neither
+archived (403 / 409); an unreadable destination is 404; a user who is not a
+member of `{pid}` is 404; moving to the same project or to a project where the
+user is already a member is 400. Tasks assigned to the user in `{pid}` stay
+there, unassigned.
+
 Statuses: `open`, `doing`, `done`. Errors are `{"error":"..."}`. Request
 bodies are JSON (`Content-Type: application/json`).
 
